<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>404 - Page Not Found | PostVisit</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;700;800&family=DM+Serif+Display:ital@0;1&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
  <style>
    *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}body{font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;background:#f5f7fb;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:100vh;text-align:center;padding:20px;}
    .error-wrap{max-width:500px}
    .error-num{font-family:'DM Serif Display',serif;font-size:120px;line-height:1;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1a6b8a,#2ecc71);-webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;background-clip:text;}
    .error-icon{font-size:48px;color:#1a6b8a;margin:16px 0}
    h1{font-size:28px;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:10px;color:#1a2332}
    p{color:#6b7a8d;margin-bottom:28px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7}
    .btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:12px 24px;border-radius:10px;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;transition:all .2s;}
    .btn--primary{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1a6b8a,#2589af);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(26,107,138,.3)}
    .btn--primary:hover{transform:translateY(-2px)}
    .btn--ghost{background:#fff;color:#1a6b8a;border:1.5px solid #e4eaf2;margin-left:10px}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="error-wrap">
  <div class="error-num">404</div>
  <div class="error-icon"><i class="fas fa-map-signs"></i></div>
  <h1>Page Not Found</h1>
  <p>The page you're looking for doesn't exist or has been moved. Let's get you back on track.</p>
  <a href="/dashboard" class="btn btn--primary"><i class="fas fa-th-large"></i> Go to Dashboard</a>
  <a href="/" class="btn btn--ghost"><i class="fas fa-home"></i> Home</a>
</div>
</body>
</html>
